ing damage from heroes and Legend Creeps interrupts channeling and puts the skill on base cooldown).\nThis skill's cooldown is increased by 600% of the target's remaining respawn time, capped at 240s. This skill is not affected by Cooldown Reduction.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eb33edd56da79e4dbe8601648e2cb07a.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":1410,"name":"Light of Retribution","description":"Rafaela strikes the three nearest enemies with Light of Retribution, dealing them 350 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, briefly revealing their positions, and slowing them by 40% for 1.5s. Enemies hit by Light of Retribution again within 6s will take 20% extra damage (this effect stacks up to 3 times).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e3672153fbf1dbeb4a98243958f9deb7.png","video":null,"cd":5.0,"cost":45.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":1420,"name":"Holy Healing","description":"Rafaela calls upon Holy Light, recovering 100 (+35% Total Magic Power) HP to nearby allied heroes, plus an additional 150 (+65% Total Magic Power) HP to herself and the most injured allied hero in range. She also increases the Movement Speed of nearby allied heroes by 30% and grants Slow Immunity for 1s.\nEvery 10  increases the Movement Speed bonus by 1%.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png","video":null,"cd":10.5,"cost":75.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Heal","rgb":"89,168,111"},{"name":"Speed Up","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":1430,"name":"Holy Baptism","description":"Rafaela unleashes the true power of Holy Light in the target direction, dealing 460 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in a line and stunning them for 1.2s.","icon":"h